# Noise handling: automation headers are skipped; unknown senders are screened
# by the model (marketing/newsletters ignored WITH an audit-log entry); known
# contacts always ingest; if the model is down, mail is kept, never dropped.
# 2026-08-03: briefly set to `imap` for the Round 7 simulation and REVERTED
# within minutes — see FINDINGS F35. The poller hardcodes `select("INBOX")` with
# no label/folder/date scoping and fetches non-PEEK, so pointing it at the
# personal Gmail this .env designates marked real personal mail as read at up to
# 750 messages/hour. Do not re-enable against a mailbox that is not a dedicated
# org inbox.
